## Completeness Checklist

### Theme
- [ ] Font loaded via @import url() in index.css (FIRST, before tailwindcss!)
- [ ] Font is NOT from forbidden list
- [ ] All CSS variables are oklch() functions
- [ ] Color palette fits the app's domain

### Core Component
